<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<rdf:RDF
  xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#"
  xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
  xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
  xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#PauseScenario">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>A system command to pause the execution of a scenario across a C2SIM coalition of systems.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N116d66266e3e4e79941b47a4be3e4600">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#TaskStatus"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Ned23705fd50b459a859b08c9890bc859">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasCurrentTask"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>The task whose status is being reported.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Nd49b814b4c804228a56dda9ebcb21951">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#CartesianOffset"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N7c8d16b79c4e442ab9dc8647e1989fa8">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasNorth"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>In meters</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ResumeScenario">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>A system command to resume the paused execution of a scenario across a C2SIM coalition of systems.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#StopPlayback">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>System command used to terminate (no resumption allowed) the playback of recorded C2SIM messages in a C2SIM coalition of systems. The name of the recording being played back is not needed here since there can be only one playback in progress at a time.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasLength">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf>
      <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasDistance">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSpatialMeasure"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Property of geospatial data value that represents an aspect of a distance.</rdfs:comment>
      </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    </rdfs:subPropertyOf>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Property of geospatial data value that represents length aspect of a distance in meters.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#RefreshInit">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nee8c1192b29a4a07a8b4a482f93cd283">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasRefreshInitSelection"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#RefreshInitSelection"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>This system command supports late joiners to the C2SIM coalition of systems. It causes a fresh copy of the C2SIMInitialization message to be sent to the requesting system. Command parameters indicate that either a copy of the startup initialization (INITIALIZATION_ORIGINAL) or an updated version with latest reported positions of each ActorEntity (INITIALIZATION_LATEST_POSITIONS) be sent to the requesting system.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Nd61a45e367e8443680c70cde18138ac8">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#OrderBody"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N29d1644dbf644345a392035edaf35ca2">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasRequestingEntity"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>The ID must refer to an Actor individual. 
The entity issuing the order might not  be the same as the Sender, if the order was relayed through another unit. This optional property supports this case.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#UnitOperationalStatusCode">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#OperationalStatusCode"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Code indicating capability of unit to perform its mission, over a range of values.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N0efa4e561a914bdea359aea7d5b5e7d6">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#OrderBody"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N07a8742d7bbb4649b36b1d55b003829c">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasOrderID"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual order.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#AbstractOrganization">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#AbstractObject"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nd980ca34ab884d36acbedf1d19d90991">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasOrganizationTypeCode"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#OrganizationTypeCode"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Ne64ddec96210494294306c786e356bc0">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasCountryCode"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#CountryCode"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nf31189db5dcd4ab7ad75290fc63774de">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasEthnicGroupCode"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#EthnicGroupCode"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nfb0f1a68352341b390b8a841eb0c26b7">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasReligionCode"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ReligionCode"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>A group that an actor can be affiliated with. Does not perform any actions and does not have a specific location.
Subclasses of this class can be created for country, religion, etc. Each of these will have defined instances (one for each country, etc.)</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N29b0239af0d24f0fa5534b4de0d06d83">
    <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
  </rdf:Description>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Nd517e3d3acff4e209805bf79b707592e">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#AllegianceRelationship"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N1e62ab101c854a1b9135ff8cbd990df6">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasActorReference"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>The object of the relation.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N6e7e85bbf35043e9be04cb899ef91b00">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#PositionReportContent"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nc1d4a51a9d4940979843a7212e8c6d78">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSubjectEntity"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual of the ActorEntity class. This property is omitted if the report is about the reporting entity. However, it must be included if the report is about, e.g., a subordinate.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#NBC_Event">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#TacticalGraphic"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Specifies a NATO APP6-C-based tactical graphics symbol for a Nuclear/Biological/Chemical event.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#C2SIMInitializationBody">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#MessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nfadcb7b7d33041b7bfc2c6a594207979">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasInitializationDataFile"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#InitializationDataFile"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N46fe0663756a491bb3dbbcc31db21f40">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasObjectDefinitions"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ObjectDefinitions"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nef851e409cc94f958cb79871718c624c">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSystemEntityList"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemEntityList"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N39d310c499e14f6891276faded20e164">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasScenarioSetting"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ScenarioSetting"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>This message can initialize all of the objects in the scenario as well as the scenario setting.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#CommunicationNetwork">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#AbstractObject"/>
    <rdfs:comment>An specific network over which an entity communicates. A logical entity. Will have data properties defining communication parameters.
Networks are part of an EntityDescriptor. If a message is sent to a CommunicationsNetwork, all ActorEntities that have this network will receive the message.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N566c0ac111224cd7a7181ece9831d123">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#Observation"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N957bcfda07ae41ca8a4716a23e6a8401">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasUncertaintyInterval"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>Uncertainty Interval is an optional qualification on an observation of a real-valued phenomenon. This is the size of the range of values (the reported value is the center) that the phenomenon could actually have. In two or three dimensions, this could be the diameter of a circle of uncertainty. The probability that the observation is in this range should be given by the ConfidenceLevel.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SubmitInitialization">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Sent by a C2SIM controller. When C2SIM systems receive this C2SIM message, they should submit Object Initialization messages for object definitions they are configured to simulate. This message contains no data; it serves as a command and is not required if a preconfigured master initialization file is used.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#Boundary">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#Line"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Specifies a NATO APP6-C-based tactical graphics symbol for a boundary line.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N4ee55cb08c414c06b5128942fa74f2a1">
    <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
  </rdf:Description>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#StartRecording">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N0072c3001e8b4f29b9a831e34c1e7344">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasName"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>System command for ordering initiation of the recording of C2SIM messages in a C2SIM coalition of systems. The recording is given a name in order to distinguish this recording from others that may have been created and stored for later use. Note that there can be only one recording in progress at a time in the C2SIM coalition of systems. Recording is executed by the C2SIM server recording C2SIM messages that are exchanged across systems in a C2SIM coalition.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasComment">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>The class has descriptive information to allow human understanding of its function.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Nd8dfc47fcf9643afa831501e328f28b8">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#OrientToLocation"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#TaskActionCode"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Orients (the heading of) an entity toward the Location or MapGraphic specified in the task.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#UnitSymbol">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#MapGraphic"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N3154a40c8cf648bcb052b9541659facb">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasOperationalStatus"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#OperationalStatus"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Ndc75e580a7b549378211651f188528a9">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasReinforcedReducedType"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#ReinforcedReducedType"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N86bdf7c97dd04ea0882372bfdcffcdca">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasHigherFormation"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N5643cc6f52184e549391dc900c7e01c6">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasSpecialC2HQ"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>Specifies a NATO APP6-C-based tactical graphics symbol for a military unit, equipment, or installation.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N8601401ee32e4e7ab68ef5f1a61716f3">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#SubjectTypeObservation"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N2abd9b1596c64ee5a74f590a25dce241">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasAPP6CSymbol"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#APP6CSymbol"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>Note that the symbol SIDC allow for "wildcards" in some fields, i.e. for aspects of the type to be unspecified.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Naeea2c08819f473fb7d017490ef81257">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#CartesianOffset"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N7651339cbe1e454f894bbf90a20a5e66">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasUp"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>In meters</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#AcknowledgementBody">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#DomainMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N7dab7b13ec984f8ebcec72977f9e4b9c">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasAcknowledgeTypeCode"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#AcknowledgeTypeCode"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>An acknowledgement from one Actor to another that a message was received.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing">
    <rdfs:comment>Superclass of all classes in this ontology.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N1c461f6eea9144048fd4f1e4b990b185">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#APP6CSymbol"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N0d52f127d34c4b5592aa341eee7fd0a3">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasAPP6C-SIDC"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>The string should have restrictions placed on it, e.g. 15 characters, etc.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#METOCGraphic">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#MapGraphic"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Specifies the NATO APP6-C-based meteorological conditions of the environment.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#ForceSide">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#AbstractObject"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nec61ea80a99e46129ccb10d6bb8e2db9">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasForceSideRelation"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#ForceSideRelation"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>Class for a collection of Entities that have the same allegiance. I.e. they are all friendly to each other. For example, ForceSides could be defined for "BLUFOR", "OPFOR", and "CIVILIAN." Entities could be associated with one of these ForceSides through the hasSide property of their EntityDescriptor object property.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Nea66f838d08748d4b4fb51a28c8884d7">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#C2SIMHeader"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N2831ac7382ab417896d4c6e9f6f4e62f">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#isInReplyToMessageID"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of a message.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Nfa2eab3a28e44d248bb415b1a39beb59">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#RelativeLocation"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N74dd3615607e49d8821157cf98806ab7">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasEntityReference"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual of the Entity class whose location is the reference for this location. The individual is defined elsewhere.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N821317cc4f6b4c85bb1203f53f6481e8">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ObjectDefinitions"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Necf5f427ae014a6fb0419c4c4cf64206">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasEntity"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Entity"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This element is optional to allow ObjectInitialization messages to define only AbstractObjects or Tasks. The usual case, however, will be for the ObjectDefinitions class to have Entity definitions.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N925f5ec4e12e4e5bb335afb9a0fe7612">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ObjectInitializationBody"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N227bd8b62b7240acbce5a1d56ad57d66">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSystemEntityList"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemEntityList"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>A C2SIM system may provide to the marshalling server its own system entity list, which the server can use to compile a master list.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N5c20a863cec847898cb3c8aa9462b768">
    <owl:annotatedSource>
      <rdfs:Datatype rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#SymbolIDCodeString">
        <owl:equivalentClass>
          <rdfs:Datatype rdf:nodeID="N41c31c036007402b884be174caa21ae2">
            <owl:onDatatype rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
            <owl:withRestrictions rdf:parseType="Collection">
              <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N4da85d52da604beb97a38ab7002d59dc">
                <xsd:pattern>[SGIWMO]{1}[PUAFNSHJKO\-]{1}[PAGMOSTUFVXLIZ\-]{1}[AP\-]{1}[A-Z\-]{6}[A-Z\-\*]{2}[\-]{2}[AECGNSX\-\*]{1}</xsd:pattern>
              </rdf:Description>
            </owl:withRestrictions>
          </rdfs:Datatype>
        </owl:equivalentClass>
      </rdfs:Datatype>
    </owl:annotatedSource>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <rdfs:Datatype rdf:nodeID="N88d4259153f340f2b942369b02e607ec">
        <owl:onDatatype rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <owl:withRestrictions rdf:parseType="Collection">
          <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N741da14a682e47fe8d9c7f23a5289036">
            <xsd:pattern>[SGIWMO]{1}[PUAFNSHJKO\-]{1}[PAGMOSTUFVXLIZ\-]{1}[AP\-]{1}[A-Z\-]{6}[A-Z\-\*]{2}[\-]{2}[AECGNSX\-\*]{1}</xsd:pattern>
          </rdf:Description>
        </owl:withRestrictions>
      </rdfs:Datatype>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This pattern permits the full range of symbols for units, including their affiliation (position 2), status (position 4) and country (positions 13-14), even though this information is either a dynamic attribute and not part of the basic type of an entity (e.g., position 2) or redundant with information specified elsewhere in the ontology (positions 13-14). C2SIM systems should ignore characters in these fields.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Neb3d40d05e044691ae38706d1ba6e80f">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#EulerAngles"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N26cb706a2189474fba58d8615aaa26f2">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasPhi"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#angle"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>Angle in radians</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#OnOrderTrigger">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#PlanPhaseTrigger"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nc372568f5b96466293a1ff4109099920">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasTaskReference"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>A trigger for the execution of a plan phase that is based on the start time of a task. Typically this task will be defined in an order and will have a TaskActionCode of ExecutePlanPhase.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#ManeuverWarfareTask">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Task"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N02b3604205614ad4b3e0d41a423b9764">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#hasRuleOfEngagement"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#RuleOfEngagement"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nc0464759443b4299835eb176eab620fb">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#hasTaskFunctionalRelation"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#TaskFunctionalRelation"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>A task with additional properties for a Maneuver Warfare Task, including a definition of rules of engagement, and a relationship to another task.

Note that the enumerated individuals in TaskActionCode have been expanded to include tasks defined by  the Joint Consultation Command Control Information Exchange Data Model (JC3IEDM) developed by the Multilateral Interoperability Programme (MIP).</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Person">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ActorEntity"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Neae574307e584e2aa982416fed00a391">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasCurrentState"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#PhysicalState"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N4231417084024d0cb2ccf7184f9b3bc8">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasMarking"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>An Entity that is an individual human being</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#RecordingStatusReport">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N1cb9a1ca64df429dae32bc9153cdc057">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasRecordingStatusCode"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#RecordingStatusCode"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N2f8e910c9f8c45ab98367eb6b9120f64">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasFileSize"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nf1b6dd1c11174d2e80407c81866f3d49">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasName"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>System command for reporting the status of the recording of C2SIM messages in a C2SIM coalition of systems. The name refers to the name given to this recording. The file size is the size of the recording file in bytes (could be a "current" file size if a recording is in progress at the time of this report).</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N601f7e8ccf76456db84b5cfe383ff642">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#OrderBody"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nb3ceba0c88344ad6804749fb496c1fe6">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasTask"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Task"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the definition of a task for this order. This property is optional, as the order may instead provide the unique identifier of a task defined elsewhere.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N83f59d3c11fd4aea9e06a7f43468be62">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#CartesianOffset"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N0656da4bc6814b3f961cc2c33748dd21">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasEast"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>In meters</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Resources">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#EntityHealthStatus"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N2018b376ab5c4c549bc61e5a77848575">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasResource"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Resource"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>A level of personnel, equipment, ammunition, fuel, etc. The user must compare this to the full strength of the unit.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#hasText">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Provides a Text annotation as part on an Object.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N998de3fa6b50407ca9ae35562e987406">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#CommandRelation"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N59f31652d8f04f70b098f18eecf6e2e6">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasActorReference"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>The object of the command relation.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N0b58158eaaf94fb187ff7749cb34a8ff">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Task"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nf3562581e7ab4f81b729d52f7c21b2c3">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasPerformingEntity"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual of the ActorEntity class.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ResumePlayback">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>System command for ordering resumption of the current playback of C2SIM messages in a C2SIM coalition of systems. The name of the recording being played back is not needed here since there can be only one playback in progress at a time.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N14517f7b58634185bee4502fd3cf40b9">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#ForceSideRelation"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nb78119e7bc2345058c1e2b81d7ca225a">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasOtherSide"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>The object of the relation--a ForceSide.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N108dfa63170e44f79ae8647e36ce398c">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#AssistOtherUnit"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#TaskActionCode"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Assist the AffectedUnit identified in the Task with the task it is performing.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#PlaybackRealtimeMultipleReport">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>System command for reporting the current setting of the playbackRealtimeMultiple value indicating the multiple of simulation time to realtime currently set for the playback of recorded messages in the C2SIM coalition of systems.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#EventTrigger">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#PlanPhaseTrigger"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N6c9cf1c25ffc4a92bf0b4b30324fa5b2">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#hasEvent"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Event"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>A trigger to start a plan phase that is based on the time of an event.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasHeight">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasDistance"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Property of geospatial data value that represents height aspect of a distance in meters.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#TaskGraphic">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#TacticalGraphic"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Specifies a NATO APP6-C-based tactical graphics symbol for a Task.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#MagicMove">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nbc0204a80ba94ed3b17de132a5f1162d">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasLocation"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Location"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N031fc42d03fa4ca6814e83ce21ae7d13">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasEntityReference"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N5435254d36de45358eb48e0057735322">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasTaskID"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N8b847bb052b043a5b3ba4335d00612db">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasTasker"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>System command used as an exercise control capabiliity to immediately reposition some entity (i.e., without going through a simulated movement). The hasEntityReference property provides the UUID of the entity being repositioned. The hasTasker property provides the UUID of the entity ordering the repositioning. The hasTaskID property gives the reference to a Task that the repositioning may be associated with.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N4cced49e93dd40cfa7d2207080dd6f5e">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#CollectiveEntity"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nfa0b6e258d7b43e1b57af7c2021c744a">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSubordinate"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual of the ActorEntity class. The individual is defined elsewhere.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#TaskRequestContent">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#RequestContent"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N768f50e99c6849498f6d82ef1e0e8376">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasTask"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Task"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>A request for an Actor to perform a Task. The Actor to perform the Task is identified by the hasPerformingEntity property of the Task.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N6996bd2057404460a68463c8a34eba2c">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Action"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Naeb7b6c88e924f3084b51aed603e292d">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasMapGraphicID"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is a reference to a MapGraphic individual defined elsewhere.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#SubsurfaceVessel">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Platform"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Underwater vehicle assembled for military use</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N6f1e268b5bd64b4f99adf884e035edd1">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Orientation"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N8fccf87ccb8b44bf951e15866fa422be">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasHeadingAngle"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#angle"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>Angle in radians, clockwise from north.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N1b7a23b6ef2249f99c773cfecfb86eb6">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ReportContent"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N3b9e67886888405eb7171e7a1b3fe4e6">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasDuration"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Duration"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>Optional duration to specify the interval of time (a duration prior to the given observation time) over which the observation was made.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#RequestBody">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#DomainMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nf0826f047705463cb3ab295a077d6f88">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasRequestContent"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#RequestContent"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N163c41a687f04ca9a081fc42316f9142">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasRequestingEntity"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>The body of a message from an actor in the domain to another actor in the domain that requests something.
A request is fulfilled at the discretion of the entity to which it is directed.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#RequestSimulationRealtimeMultiple">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>System command for requesting the current setting of the simuationRealtimeMultiple value indicating the multiple of simulation time to realtime currently set for the simulation systems in the C2SIM coalition of systems.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#LocationObservation">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#Observation"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nfacdeb97713841bdb45d55226b5cbbaa">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasLocation"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Location"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N2b232fa5b44c498b8ea17906af56aca9">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasDirectionOfMovement"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Orientation"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N4177fcb34793439196b5e9b5dc91b743">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSpeed"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>An observation of the location of a subject.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#PausePlayback">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>System command for pausing the playback of recorded C2SIM messages in a C2SIM coalition of systems. The name of the recording being played back is not needed here since there can be only one playback in progress at a time.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#StopRecording">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>System command used to terminate (no resumption allowed) the recording of C2SIM messages in a C2SIM coalition of systems. The name of the recording  is not needed here since there can be only one recording in progress at a time.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Nde8721d2edac423b86e79bf6e3cea2ba">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UseCapability"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#TaskActionCode"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Use the main or default capability that the actor posseses.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N3875a6496fe34e03a6416338b174546e">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#PlanPhase"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N093cee5a4abf4e838575ef62109d1548">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasTaskReference"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>These are references to tasks to be performed in this plan phase. If the tasks have not been previously defined, this property should be omitted and the tasks defined in the hasTask property.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N383789acbea24ebf9295f99c1bf16393">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Action"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N5bcfbdb295e8418f8e46f0bc1ed3ed43">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasLocation"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Location"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>The general location of the task, if that makes sense. Specification of multiple locations where events of the task take place is normally done with map graphics.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemAcknowledgementBody">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#MessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nfa9977b93e6c45e787f829a754b93026">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasAcknowledgeTypeCode"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#AcknowledgeTypeCode"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>An acknowledgement from one C2SIM system to another that a message was received.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N79ed007ddfcd4617a718f6c560cd311d">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ActorEntity"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N33e0d73809ef4ef2b262b6d573ab58ae">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasCurrentTask"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual of the Task class. The individual is defined elsewhere.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Nd0c18734b6424287bdf3882e95d0effb">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Action"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N6a13c70fa3884ea19f561f93230d2e2b">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasUUID"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual in this class.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Nef795e2df2c747099a2652bb67aa3cd6">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#EntityDescriptor"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N3f45fa6fa0fa4eca8924b1c899a1ae8b">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#isAffiliatedWith"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual of the AbstractOrganization class to which this entity is affiliated. Since AbstractOrganizations are not Actors, this is not a command relationship, but a descriptive attribute of the entity.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#MIPRequestContent">
