      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N6c33dfb92c3849ae9689b00fb8f68c6c">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasPlaybackStatusCode"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#PlaybackStatusCode"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N9486f829c777498885665841ac21894b">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasName"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nec9f1b2cf97741ccadba4f3cd8696da2">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasPlaybackRealtimeMultiple"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Ndbd9d4b83bed4869ad403d76be55d21e">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasPlaybackPosition"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N3bc5fd24f508498190f96e593811159e">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasTimeSincePlaybackStart"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#IsoTimeDurationBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>System command for reporting the status of the playback of recorded C2SIM messages in a C2SIM coalition of systems. The name refers to the name of the recording being played back at the time of this report. Playback position may be  something like sequence number in the recording file. The format and the meaning of the string value is out of the scope of the C2SIM standard, and should be defined at the Federation level (interoperability across different Federations is not guaranteed). The time since playback start gives the time duration (isoTimeDurationBase) since the start time of the current playback (i.e., the message timestamp that the playback has reached). The playbackRealtimeMultiple is the current setting of the rate at which recorded messages are being played back.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SimulationRealtimeMultipleReport">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N14eb9dabb118454cb6cf498abc7ae9de">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSimulationRealtimeMultiple"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#simulationRealtimeMultiple"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>System command for reporting the current setting of the simuationRealtimeMultiple value indicating the multiple of simulation time to realtime currently set for the simulation systems in the C2SIM coalition of systems.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N8e51395651d346d18eeba6ac3abfd092">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ReportPosition"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#TaskActionCode"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Requests the receiving entity to reply with a position report.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N23da5d4081524ad285e947d3b581be3a">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#PhysicalState"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N9bcab1a5c1954fabaf3f450cc15333bf">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasEntityHealthStatus"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#EntityHealthStatus"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This property has cardinality 0+ to allow for multiple health measures, e.g. operational status and a resource status.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N15866c83711b4fe4befdc0d8c4c0dde1">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#RelativeTime"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nda656ce24196453190f64df9c5046f91">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasEventReference"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual of theh Event class that is the reference for this time instant. If the Event has a duration, then the time reference is the start time of the event.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N319126afca3c478ea5e4ce0e49d40e07">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#EntityDescriptor"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Ndfff9caca6574191913ed97589761fd9">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSuperior"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual of the ActorEntity class who is this entity's superior in a command and control hierarchy.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Nd8bc77dc18304c71b7652b75309fc54e">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Entity"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N399ab09654214b48a306a898aaba903b">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasUUID"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual of this class.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox">
    <rdfs:comment>Version 1.0.0 SISO Standard, May 2020</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:versionInfo>C2SIM Land Operations Extension v1.0.0</owl:versionInfo>
  </owl:Ontology>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Neda82ff35cab416989c23c384cad1f05">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#AbstractObject"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N0a5d7d866c6a4f649c9fda3d1c091667">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasUUID"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual in this class.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N4098b4b439db46e5bfe6d1e448f0fcdd">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Overlay"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Na0252346f7c84bdb877752f19037d873">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasEntityReference"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual of the Entity class that is in this overlay. The individual is defined elsewhere. The entity could be an actor or a graphic, for example.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N770eb320402b4a4faed3e1fe88f71a1c">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#DomainMessageBody"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N0f75e4641c9248dd9dc9aae045a9ef33">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#isFromSender"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique indentifier of an individual of the ActorEntity class who is the sender of this message. The individual is defined elsewhere.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N04d30bdd46f8421c81432f3e7fe0fdc1">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#HoldInPlace"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#TaskActionCode"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Do not move.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Heading">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Orientation"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Heading is the rotation clockwise relative to local grid north. This is a rotation about one axis; other axis orientations are unspecified, and if a system needs values they can be assumed to be zero or appropriate angles to clamp the entity to the ground.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <rdfs:Datatype rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#entityTypeString">
    <rdfs:comment>A string, possibly with several separated fields that can each hold an enumeration, thus identifying a category at each level of a hierarchy.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdfs:Datatype>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#StopScenario">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>This C2SIM message is sent to all subscribed systems indicating that the simulation should be stopped and won’t be restarted. All initialization data should be discarded, and all systems should prepare to reinitialize.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N3f0cf106a5eb40c0ada8754b27fd3e7b">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#C2SIMHeader"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N17473be9e52b49f9b139ac041d142a2e">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasConversationID"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of a conversation. A conversation is a concept outside of the C2SIM data model.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N80effe3fb4444c28bb1ad3b634fb72f8">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#EntityDescriptor"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nc768f1e94b5649768cfb186904635ca4">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasCommunicationsNetwork"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual of the CommunicationNetwork class to which this entity belongs.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Strength">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#EntityHealthStatus"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N3d2b2607d6c841e787d61e3ab8405b17">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasStrengthPercentage"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#percentage"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>Representation of the strength of an entity expressed as a percentage of some starting value.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#NonMilitaryOrganization">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#CollectiveEntity"/>
    <rdfs:comment>An organization operating external to military authority (e.g., law enforcement, non-governmental organizations).</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N369dff2dbc904f83b79a5c51fb53fd57">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Observe"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#TaskActionCode"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Either generally observe, or observe the Location or AffectedEntity specified in the Task.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N7a6695da28a84fa2aa83ecf0f97bf819">
    <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
  </rdf:Description>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ResumeRecording">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>System command for ordering resumption of recording of C2SIM messages in a C2SIM coalition of systems. The name of the recording in progress is not needed here since there can be only one recording in progress at a time.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Nbe9bea18e3744bbd96859ab72feee634">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#DomainMessageBody"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N1142a277162c4546844cd72a359b5f88">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#isToReceiver"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual of the ActorEntity class OR an individual of the CommunicationNetwork class that is the intended recipient of this message. If the recipient is a CommunicationsNetwork, then all ActorEntities that have this network will receive the message.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#Vehicle">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Platform"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Vehicle assembled for military use; most often applies to ground vehicle</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SetSimulationRealtimeMultiple">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nf3de24d57f824b2f8188b5201952bd5e">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSimulationRealtimeMultiple"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#simulationRealtimeMultiple"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>System command for setting the simuationRealtimeMultiple value indicating the  multiple of simulation time to realtime for the simulation systems in the C2SIM coalition of systems.The SetSimulationRealtimeMultiple enables a user in a C2SIM coalition to direct participating simulations to execute at a rate faster or slower than realtime. For example, a simulationRealtimeMultiple value of 2.0 directs participating simulations to operate at 2:1 simulation time to realtime (i.e., faster than realtime); a value of 0.5 directs participating simulations to operate at half realtime (i.e., slower than realtime).</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#Point">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#TacticalGraphic"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Specifies a NATO APP6-C-based tactical graphics symbol for a point location.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#InitializationComplete">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>This C2SIM message is sent by each participating system in a C2SIM coalition of systems in response to the C2SIM initialization message, after that system has completed its initialization processing.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Nf396d0d02c1646a3a5904e2e4f750810">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#EulerAngles"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nf3e18252985346848c1a382f3727ec6b">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasTheta"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#angle"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>Angle in radians</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#Aircraft">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Platform"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Air vehicle assembled for military use</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#RequestPlaybackStatus">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>System command for requesting information about the current playback of recorded C2SIM messages in a C2SIM coalition of systems.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#minQualifiedCardinality"/>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#RequestRecordingStatus">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>System command for requesting information about the current recording of C2SIM messages in a C2SIM coalition of systems.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N815acb6eb2a44b15b932b72dd74bef86">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Task"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N28350cd7a31942d8b3499538754d8f98">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasAffectedEntity"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual of the ActorEntity class.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="Ne86b0437ba6540c48828a4a979fe5c2d">
    <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="Nfe608405ef7b44dfbcf131841316cc29">
    <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
  </rdf:Description>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#Route">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#Line"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Specifies a NATO APP6-C-based tactical graphics symbol for a route line.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Ncee32bfe2fb846eab99b4ba0735185b9">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#ExecutePlanPhase"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#TaskActionCode"/>
    <rdfs:comment>This code indicates that the task is to execute a previously provided plan phase.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Ne8d54636bc794657a08a7f4d390ecf42">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#OrderBody"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N30e0d5acee6f4607a2e7fc8d2e5f897f">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasEntity"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#MapGraphic"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This optional property allows the order to define map graphics for use in the task.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#EnvironmentalObject">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#PhysicalEntity"/>
    <rdfs:comment>A specified region in which the environment (e.g. weather, ocean state) is defined by a particular Environmental State.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#CheckpointSave">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Ncf0f479588044e92bb8e3477c2e71e19">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasName"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>The CheckpointSave system command directs systems in a C2SIM coalition to save their current state. The name is used to distinguish the current set of saved data from other named checkpoints.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#GeographicFeature">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#PhysicalEntity"/>
    <rdfs:comment>A geographic feature generally used for location reference. For example a hill, river, etc.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N0de9abaf7e054fa09706634302e8ecaa">
    <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
  </rdf:Description>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="N47254b2b3ec245e78d8a48df85cf39a0">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#OrderBody"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nb3dbba5257db488e909b8cc990ab3bdf">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasTaskReference"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This is the unique identifier of an individual of Task class. This property is optional, as the individual may be defined in this message in the hasTask property.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Axiom rdf:nodeID="Nea0ccdfa51e64394b003fa30fb0f9a42">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#NameObservation"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nec4749acb2e74fd484458fe1292ada9a">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasHostilityStatusCode"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#HostilityStatusCode"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </owl:annotatedTarget>
    <rdfs:comment>This code allows representation of temporary and dynamic hostility status to an observed entity.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Axiom>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#HealthObservation">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#Observation"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N2cd2c509c5d646e0b6b8f0e139d88b17">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasEntityHealthStatus"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#EntityHealthStatus"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>An observation of the health state of a subject; for example operational status or resource count.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#CheckpointRestore">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nfe2bb0a0786c4005bf0486f50a627650">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasName"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>The CheckpointRestore system command directs systems in a C2SIM coalition to restore their state to the saved data in the named checkpoint file.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#PauseRecording">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemMessageBody"/>
    <rdfs:comment>System command for pausing the recording of C2SIM messages in a C2SIM coalition of systems. The name of the recording in progress is not needed here since there can be only one recording in progress at a time.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#ObservationReportContent">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ReportContent"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Na35ab319ae8c486f8658286b5b16bcb7">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasObservation"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#Observation"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>This report contains an observation of some aspect of a subject--not necessarily including the location, health, or other facts that are in a position report.
Multiple observations all refer to the same observed actor.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#GeodeticCoordinate">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Location"/>
