  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#PlanPhase">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#C2SIMContent"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N4ff7e1e1089243d8af54d531d113c23d">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#hasSubPhase"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#PlanPhase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nab890df46ea649098928557859ae3098">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#hasPlanPhaseCompletionCondition"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#PlanPhaseCompletionCondition"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N4a1637d493dc4ee19c88f1ae49a8d618">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#hasPlanPhaseTrigger"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#PlanPhaseTrigger"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N17c67692e19847339b1dd1e29beeaad4">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasTaskReference"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>A plan for a unit. A PlanPhase may a single task for a unit, or tasks for multiple units (one each), or (recursively) multiple subphases.
Phases have completion conditions that indicate when they are complete, as well as Boolean flags that indicate whether the phase is active and whether it is complete.
Phases have trigger conditions that indicate when they start.  Phases may start on the completion of another phase--thus forming a task sequence--on receipt of an order, or at the time of an Event.
 A sequence of tasks for one unit is normally represented as a sequence of subphases in order to express the triggering conditions for each task; however a set of tasks for a unit may be included in a phase and executed with some implicit sequencing such as task time.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasProtocol">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Instances of the class have a code identifying a protocol applicable to that class.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasReplyToSystem">
