      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nb38dfda7a3b3437c8ca29e023cde4e45">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSpatialOffset"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SpatialOffset"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N7bf4b824914d4ec6840a83b08c729aa4">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasEntityReference"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>A location defined by an offset to some reference location.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasOperationalStatus">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#topObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#OperationalStatus"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Indicates the level to which a military unit is prepared to carry out its combat functions, from a range of values.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasLongitude">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasCoordinateValue"/>
    <rdfs:range>
      <rdfs:Datatype rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#longitude">
        <owl:equivalentClass>
          <rdfs:Datatype rdf:nodeID="N9e0f61bb60c746b7a9b3c6e8b2005b65">
            <owl:onDatatype rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
            <owl:withRestrictions rdf:parseType="Collection">
              <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N7e07c5571f6c469ba48a79f83f52557b">
                <xsd:minInclusive rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double">-180.0</xsd:minInclusive>
              </rdf:Description>
              <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N2246585ee17a4400b23d0c217946ec82">
                <xsd:maxInclusive rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double">180.0</xsd:maxInclusive>
              </rdf:Description>
            </owl:withRestrictions>
          </rdfs:Datatype>
        </owl:equivalentClass>
      </rdfs:Datatype>
    </rdfs:range>
    <rdfs:comment>Value for Longitude coordinate is included. This should have a range specified of -180 to +180 (degrees)</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Resource">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#C2SIMContent"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N0bdf30c4d0244fe5a8d7415f78a8b81a">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSISOEntityType"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SISOEntityType"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N26b53e5db50a43ae861aca911d5fb622">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasOperationalQuantity"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N35df011d10cb4707bc28d3eb0c511778">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasName"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N544e812b3329427aae8379ea85fe0058">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasOnHandQuantity"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N13ec418f05ad4f269881816e174ba352">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasRequiredOnHandQuantity"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>This is a resource that can be part of, transferred to, or removed from an object (Entity), but is not an entity itself; therefore it does not have a location, extent, or other physical attributes.
Resource can be used to manage (a) consumable material (such as ammunition and fuel); (b) equipment (such as weapons, vehicles, and communication devices); and (c) personnel.
A resource is defined by the SISO entity type of the resource, the operational quantity of the resource (available for operations), and optionnaly with required and "on hand" quantities.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <rdfs:Datatype rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#IsoDateTimeBase">
    <owl:equivalentClass>
      <rdfs:Datatype rdf:nodeID="N38634acdc1b64744856bcf7eb243f48a">
        <owl:onDatatype rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <owl:withRestrictions rdf:parseType="Collection">
          <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N4318ff6690774dfc8b8f35b4948db50e">
            <xsd:pattern>[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}[T]{1}[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}[Z]{1}</xsd:pattern>
          </rdf:Description>
        </owl:withRestrictions>
      </rdfs:Datatype>
    </owl:equivalentClass>
  </rdfs:Datatype>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasOwner">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasAbstractObjectReference"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Provides a reference to the Owner associated with a class.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasScenarioSetting">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ScenarioSetting"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Provides a reference to a ScenarioSetting class associated with initiatlization.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasAuthorizationCredentials">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>The actual authentication tokens or encoded user credentials. The format and content depend on the authentication scheme (see property hasAuthorizationType).</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#OrganizationTypeCode">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#OrganizationCode"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Alphabetic code up to six letters describing the type of an organization, obtained from JC3IEDM-3.0.2 GroupOrganisationTypeCategoryCode</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasCommunicationsNetwork">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasAbstractObjectReference"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
    <rdfs:comment>The reference is to a class identifying a communications network.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasPlaybackStatusCode">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasCode"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#PlaybackStatusCode"/>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#SystemEntityList">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#InitializationConcept"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N4d6ea798f6d24139a94e89323a834bc5">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasActorReference"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N2a9ba02523e44cb391ffa3dcf838bf79">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSystemName"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>This is a listing of entities that reside within a system. The list defines what system a message should be sent to in order to get it to a given actor.  Each entity can reside on only one system. This list does not define necessarily define the complete list of entities on the given system.
Systems can build a map from this and other lists to get the system from a given entity.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#isFromSender">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasActorReference"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
    <rdfs:comment>The reference is to an instance of Entity that sent associated information.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#hasPlanPhaseCompletionCondition">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#PlanPhaseCompletionCondition"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Provides a condition for completion of a LOX PlanPhase.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#EntityDescriptor">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#C2SIMContent"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Na41bcbf6ae1e42858bbddc484fab21ee">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasAllegianceRelationship"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#AllegianceRelationship"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N1b3353418503450190630b5a01b8e003">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasCommunicationsNetwork"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N6f07fbcccf7049adb9311ff4b9a86983">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#isAffiliatedWith"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N8c2895173dd04b678fabd43d65e8fe7e">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSuperior"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N61fe01b1ace94453a30b06d50949b743">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasSide"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>The Descriptor defines static attributes of an entity, i.e. that do not change during the course of the simulation. This information is provided at initialization time.

The friend/hostile/... relationship of this entity with others can be specfied with hasAllegianceRelationship properties and/or the hasSide property. The hasSide property can define this entity as a member of a "Force" or "Side," i.e. a team of entities that are friendly to each other and are all friendly, hostile or neutral to other defined teams. ForceSides are abstract objects.
The entity can also have friendly, hostile or neutral relationships with specific other objects as defined by its hasAllegianceRelationship properties. These can be used in place of ForceSide membership, or they can be used along with ForceSide memberships to define exceptions.

The isAffiliatedWith property defines organizations that this entity is affiliated with. These organizations are abstract; they are not actors.

C2 structures can be defined by using the hasSuperior property.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#hasSide">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasAbstractObjectReference"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Provides a reference to the ForceSide associated with a class.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ActionTemporalRelationship">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Relationship"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N97ee5cf5b6884338b6c6a986cd512a94">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasActionTemporalAssociationCode"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#ActionTemporalAssociationCode"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N2d3b4493223a4f76969e262d836a2129">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasDuration"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Duration"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N6bd1e01f0f9d4699a7ebeaf7b603b1ea">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasTemporalAssociationWithAction"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>A temporal relationship between two actions. Some relationships involve a time duration.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#PhysicalState">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#EntityState"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N27006de9bfa44e2982ee61eeacc9e04c">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasEntityHealthStatus"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#EntityHealthStatus"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N98c38ea97ed14094a4ca86051d0763c2">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasLocation"/>
        <owl:minQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Location"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nd2e9c208197d4e3cb1c505c82ca77b4b">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasDirectionOfMovement"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Orientation"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Na10f3b1cbbc74f58b5ce904a620a99b0">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasOrientation"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onClass rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Orientation"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nd21a839f70e6417ab320bef66b7dbf67">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSpeed"/>
        <owl:maxQualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxQualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>Description of the physical state of an entity, including location, orientation, health, speed, etc.
Note that an EnvironmentalState class should be a subclass of PhysicalState. The EnvironmentalState could be the state of, for example, a smoke plume, which would have a location and could have direction, orientation, and speed.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/smx#CommandRelationCode">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Code"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Enumerations of possible relationships between a unit and the unit that commands it. Obtained from JC3IEDM-v3.0.1.ObjectItemAssociationSubcategoryCode</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/lox#hasFunctionalAssociationWithTask">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf>
      <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasTaskReference">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasActionReference"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
        <rdfs:comment>The reference is to another class identifying a Task.</rdfs:comment>
      </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    </rdfs:subPropertyOf>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#UUIDBase"/>
    <rdfs:comment>This property identifies the UUID of a Maneuver Warfare Task that is the object of a JC3IEDM ActionFunctionalAssociation.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasLatitude">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasCoordinateValue"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#latitude"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Value for Latitude coordinate is included. This should have a range specified of -90 to +90 (degrees)</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#Duration">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#TemporalConcept"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N3145b68194d148ac972724eda051f927">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasIsoTimeDuration"/>
        <owl:qualifiedCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:qualifiedCardinality>
        <owl:onDataRange rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#IsoTimeDurationBase"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:comment>A time duration expressed in ISO 8601:2000 duration format PnYnMnDTnHnMnS e.g. P00Y00M00DT00H00M00S. Note that this does not support fractions of seconds. From MSDL simple types.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasSimulationRealtimeMultiple">
    <rdfs:range>
      <rdfs:Datatype rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#simulationRealtimeMultiple">
        <rdfs:comment>simulationRealtimeMultiple is a datatype for setting the simulation time to realtime multiplier. It is defined as a positive decimal type. For example, a value of 2.5 indicates a simulation is advancing the simulation time 2.5 times faster than realtime. A value of 0.5 indicates a simulation is advancing the simulation time at half the realtime clock, or running half the speed of realtime. For example, a slower rate is sometimes used to slow down a simulation to allow more time for human operator interaction.</rdfs:comment>
        <owl:equivalentClass>
          <rdfs:Datatype rdf:nodeID="Ncb76a237172b49bbb18b685a609182a3">
            <owl:onDatatype rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
            <owl:withRestrictions rdf:parseType="Collection">
              <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="Nba212201df534efda469f6869534bc2a">
                <xsd:minExclusive rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.0</xsd:minExclusive>
              </rdf:Description>
            </owl:withRestrictions>
          </rdfs:Datatype>
        </owl:equivalentClass>
      </rdfs:Datatype>
    </rdfs:range>
    <rdfs:comment>Decimal rate indicating ratio of simulation time to real time (e.g., value of 2.0 indicates simulation is executing at 2:1 simulation time to realtime [i.e., faster than realtime]; 0.5 indicates simulation  is executing at half realtime [i.e., slower than realtime]).</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasDISSpecific">
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.sisostds.org/ontologies/C2SIM#hasDISCode"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#byte"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Provides a Specific Code from the DIS standard IEEE 1516-2010.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:DatatypeProperty>
