    <rdfs:comment>The structure for sending order messages.
This message may define tasks, or it may refer to tasks defined elsewhere (such as in an initialization message).
An order generally comes from an entity with command authority and thus is expected to be obeyed if it is physically possible to do so.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
